               <t:bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/36J4KMXD"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Makweriya1976DersanaGabriel"/><title level="m">ድርሳነ፡ ገብርኤል። ከግዕዝ ወደአማርኛ፡ ተተርጓምና ተዘጋጅቶ (Dǝrsāna Gabrǝʾel, kagǝʿǝz wadaʾamārǝññā tatargʷǝmǝnnā tazagāǧǧǝto, ’Homiliary of Gabriel, translated from Gǝʿǝz to Amharic’)</title><author><name>Makʷǝriyā ʾAbyehoy</name></author><pubPlace>Addis Ababa</pubPlace><date>1976</date><note type="accessed">2026-01-14</note><note type="url">https://betamasaheft.eu/manuscripts/EMIP01281/</note><note type="tags"><note type="tag">bm:Makweriya1976DersanaGabriel</note></note><note type="tag">bm:Makweriya1976DersanaGabriel</note><t:citedRange unit="page">8–13</t:citedRange></t:bibl>
            </t:listBibl>
